1. Background and scope
-----------------------
Goal
- Build a reproducible churn analysis and scoring pipeline from raw Telco churn data through feature engineering, model training, and an API for scoring.

Scope
- All phases of the Customer Intelligence Labs workflow were addressed except Phase 4 (React). The work added a reusable cleaner, integrated ingestion scripts, improved the API to load models at runtime, aligned ORM types for numeric columns, added a unit test for the cleaner, and produced comprehensive documentation.

Constraints
- You requested the repository remain runnable on your local machine as-is. I did not change environment variables or the existing database connection string. I did make Python-level changes (ORM types, routing logic, new modules) that require local re-import or minor DB updates if your local schema differs.

