-------------------------------------
Primary data files (in repository root)
- WA_Fn-UseC_-Telco-Customer-Churn(in).csv — original Telco churn dataset (Kaggle source referenced in lab PDF)
- telecom_churn.csv — alternate copy
- customer_features.csv — derived feature file (existing)

Important code and artifacts
- scripts/customer_cleaner.py — new: reusable data cleaner and small CLI
- load.py — modified to use the cleaner and write table `main1`
- Load_Features.py — updated to ensure numeric TotalCharges and write `customer_features`
